</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2007/01/14 (日) 15:56:48 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:mst_kg@ybb.ne.jp">天爛</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200701140155648_log_tenki.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200701140155648"></font>
